      "message": "I thought we blocked deep sleep if there were outstanding timers....\n\n\u003e-------\u003e-------/* Don\u0027t enable sleep if there is about to be an event */\n\u003e-------\u003e-------next_evt_us \u003d __hw_clock_event_get() - __hw_clock_source_read();\n\n\nSo we won\u0027t be sleeping ever unless next_event_us exceeds EVENT_MIN which is 500us granularity it seems. We\u0027d be burning power in this case.",
