        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-02-06T19:21:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is a speculative call in case there is a pending reset request. We want to flash the event mask so that that pending reset does not trigger a reset when task  Is the comment not clear?\n\n(0) means exit immediately if there is no pending events, -1 would mean wait indefinitely, which we don\u0027t want to do here in case the reset event is not going to be generated.",
      "parentUuid": "98d63c9f_5a7bf3b8",
      "revId": "5f83d5f78fec32c74dffe9da02b2a2f8c40438e0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
